  "description": "Tiny, fast, dependency-free PDF writer for .NET and .NET MAUI (Android/iOS). Subset-embedded TrueType fonts with full Unicode, Arabic shaping and right-to-left text, separate Latin/Arabic fonts in one line, word wrap, tables with page breaks, PNG (with transparency) and JPEG images, links. No reflection: trim- and AOT-safe.",
